# API Contracts: Book Embeddings Ingestion

## Overview
This document defines the API contracts for the book embeddings ingestion system based on the functional requirements.

## Ingestion Service API

### 1. Ingest Book Content
**Endpoint**: `POST /api/v1/ingest`
**Purpose**: Crawl and extract content from a book URL

#### Request
```json
{
  "url": "https://example-book.vercel.app",
  "options": {
    "include_pages": [],
    "exclude_patterns": [],
    "max_pages": 1000
  }
}
```

#### Response (Success)
```json
{
  "job_id": "ingest-job-12345",
  "status": "processing",
  "source_url": "https://example-book.vercel.app",
  "estimated_completion": "2023-10-05T14:30:00Z",
  "created_at": "2023-10-05T14:00:00Z"
}
```

#### Response (Error)
```json
{
  "error": "invalid_url",
  "message": "The provided URL is not accessible or not a valid book site",
  "details": {
    "url": "https://example-book.vercel.app",
    "status_code": 404
  }
}
```

### 2. Get Ingestion Status
**Endpoint**: `GET /api/v1/ingest/{job_id}`
**Purpose**: Check the status of an ongoing ingestion job

#### Response
```json
{
  "job_id": "ingest-job-12345",
  "status": "completed",
  "progress": 100,
  "total_pages": 250,
  "processed_pages": 250,
  "failed_pages": 0,
  "started_at": "2023-10-05T14:00:00Z",
  "completed_at": "2023-10-05T14:25:00Z",
  "summary": {
    "total_chunks": 500,
    "total_tokens": 125000,
    "total_embeddings": 500
  }
}
```

## Embedding Service API

### 3. Generate Embeddings
**Endpoint**: `POST /api/v1/embeddings/generate`
**Purpose**: Generate embeddings for text chunks

#### Request
```json
{
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "chunk-1",
      "content": "This is the first text chunk...",
      "metadata": {
        "source_url": "https://example-book.vercel.app/chapter-1",
        "location": "Chapter 1, page 5"
      }
    }
  ],
  "model": "embed-multilingual-v3.0",
  "input_type": "search_document"
}
```

#### Response (Success)
```json
{
  "job_id": "embed-job-67890",
  "status": "completed",
  "model": "embed-multilingual-v3.0",
  "embeddings": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk-1",
      "embedding": [0.1, 0.3, -0.2, ...],
      "embedding_size": 1024
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Response (Error)
```json
{
  "error": "embedding_generation_failed",
  "message": "Failed to generate embeddings due to API error",
  "details": {
    "failed_chunks": ["chunk-1"],
    "reason": "API rate limit exceeded"
  }
}
```

## Storage Service API

### 4. Store Embeddings
**Endpoint**: `POST /api/v1/storage/store`
**Purpose**: Store embeddings in the vector database

#### Request
```json
{
  "embeddings": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk-1",
      "embedding": [0.1, 0.3, -0.2, ...],
      "payload": {
        "text_chunk_id": "chunk-1",
        "source_url": "https://example-book.vercel.app/chapter-1",
        "source_location": "Chapter 1, page 5",
        "book_title": "Example Book Title",
        "book_author": "Author Name"
      }
    }
  ],
  "collection_name": "book_embeddings"
}
```

#### Response (Success)
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "stored_count": 1,
  "collection_name": "book_embeddings",
  "indexed_points": ["point-id-123"]
}
```

### 5. Search Embeddings
**Endpoint**: `POST /api/v1/storage/search`
**Purpose**: Perform vector similarity search

#### Request
```json
{
  "query_embedding": [0.2, -0.1, 0.4, ...],
  "collection_name": "book_embeddings",
  "limit": 5,
  "with_payload": true,
  "with_vectors": false
}
```

#### Response
```json
{
  "results": [
    {
      "id": "point-id-123",
      "score": 0.85,
      "payload": {
        "text_chunk_id": "chunk-1",
        "source_url": "https://example-book.vercel.app/chapter-1",
        "source_location": "Chapter 1, page 5",
        "content": "This is the matching text content..."
      }
    }
  ],
  "query_time_ms": 12.5
}
```

## Configuration Service API

### 6. Get Configuration
**Endpoint**: `GET /api/v1/config`
**Purpose**: Retrieve current configuration settings

#### Response
```json
{
  "config": {
    "chunk_size": 512,
    "chunk_overlap": 50,
    "embedding_model": "embed-multilingual-v3.0",
    "qdrant_collection": "book_embeddings",
    "cohere_api_key_set": true,
    "qdrant_api_key_set": true
  }
}
```

### 7. Update Configuration
**Endpoint**: `PUT /api/v1/config`
**Purpose**: Update configuration settings

#### Request
```json
{
  "config": {
    "chunk_size": 1024,
    "chunk_overlap": 100,
    "embedding_model": "embed-multilingual-v3.0"
  }
}
```

#### Response
```json
{
  "status": "updated",
  "updated_config": {
    "chunk_size": 1024,
    "chunk_overlap": 100,
    "embedding_model": "embed-multilingual-v3.0"
  }
}
```